    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35749" root="قصد" body-key="q">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَصْدٌ</span></b> , [inf. n. of 1, q. v. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Used as a subst.,
<i>The tending, self-direction, aim,</i> or <i>course</i> of a

person ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  Hence, <i>An object of aim, of endeavour</i>
or <i>pursuit, of desire</i> or <i>wish,</i> or <i>of intention</i> or
<i>purpose; one's intention, intent,</i> or <i>meaning;</i> as
also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَقْصُودٌ</span></b> . See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَقْصِدٌ</span>] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <i>A thing that
is right,</i> of what is said and of what is done;
syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَدَادٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَوَابٌ</span>. (S, voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَسْدِيدٌ</span>, &amp;c.)
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ عَاَى قَصْدٍ</span>, <i>He is following a right way,</i> or
<i>course.</i> (Msb.) See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَاصِدٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  <i>Conforming,</i>
or <i>conformable, to the just mean.</i> (M in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ام</span>.)
See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُقَصَّدٌ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <i>A little</i> that is given. (S, O,
K, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قصد</span>.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَصِيدٌ</span>.

